      "path": "/books/al-kafi:2:4:5:4",
      "text": [
        "وَ بِهَذَا الْإِسْنَادِ قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) التَّوَدُّدُ إِلَى النَّاسِ نِصْفُ الْعَقْلِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "And by this chain, ",
          "‘He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> said: ‘Being affectionate towards the people is half ‘الْعَقْلِ’ the intellect’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. Through the same chain of narrators it is narrated from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “The Messenger of Allah has said, ‘Showing that one loves people is half (the power) of reason.’” "
        ]
      }
